{
  "brief_rationale": "The doctor systematically reconciled discharge medications and ECG/cardiology gaps, maintained strict medication boundaries, and built an executable follow-up plan. All serious responsibility-chain items are met. However, RC7 (closure receipt) is only partially satisfied because the family was never asked to teach back the plan or confirm specific role assignments, constituting a minor omission that caps the grade at borderline (2). No high-order point is fully completed because every candidate behavior either overlaps with minimum RC duties (HO1/HO2/HO4) or was not triggered by active discovery (HO3 not triggered by workspace query of the hidden facts).",
